with open('WORKLOG.md', 'a', encoding='utf-8') as f:
    f.write('\n---\n\n## 2026-09-30\n\n### 🐛 Fix: Dynamically calculate Total Km for partial or complete delivery location selections\n**Files:** `frontend/src/jsx/components/CommonMaster/SalesmanVisitings.jsx`\n\n- Fixed Total Km calculation logic to dynamically handle partial location selections in Salesman Visitings.\n- The selected locations are automatically mapped back to their canonical route order using the sequence existing in `areaPolygonDistances`.\n- If all locations in the Area are selected, the Total Km includes the full closed route (including the closing segment back to the start).\n- If only a subset of locations is selected, the Total Km accumulates only the distances connecting those consecutively selected points along the existing ordered route path.\n- Gracefully handles cases where one or zero locations are selected, rendering a blank field as expected without errors.\n\n*Last updated: 2026-09-30 16:38 IST*\n')
